WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.419
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:04.296
The three of us formed a school idol group...

00:00:04.296 --> 00:00:08.258
and decided to hold our debut
concert during the Welcome Party.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:11.177
But we have a lot to do before then!

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.097
We need to decide on a
name for our idol group.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:14.973
Um, what song?

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:18.768
There's only a month left before showtime,
but we really want to sing an original song.

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:20.520
IIUISII?

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.522
I believe you read that as "Muse."

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.649
Well, except it says "u's" on it.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:26.276
It's our...

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.819
Our own song...

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:37.912
One, two, three, four,

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:38.913
five, six, seven...

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:40.749
Kotori-chan, careful with your left hand.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.001
Honoka.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:43.543
Tag!

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:45.962
Looking good.

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:46.921
Yeah!

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:48.840
Let's take a three-minute break.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.054
We finished...

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.389
There's still practice after school, you know.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.267
Haven't we improved a whole lot, though?

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:02.562
I never would have thought you two
would take this all so seriously.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.273
I assumed Honoka would always
oversleep and show up late.

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:09.110
Don't sweat it. I get plenty
of sleep during class!

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:12.989
Nishikino-san!

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:14.282
Maki-chan!

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:17.869
Don't shout my name.

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:18.620
Why not?

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.038
It's embarrassing!

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.831
Oh, right. The song...

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:25.085
We tried singing it together. C'mon, listen!

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.920
What? Why should 1?

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:27.879
Because...

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.091
You wrote this song for us, didn't you?

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.136
I'm telling you, that wasn't m—

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.346
That story again?

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:42.102
Rawr!

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.354
Huh? What are you doing?

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:50.527
No!

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:53.988
Nice! Mission accomplished!

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.036
I think we did a decent job singing it.

00:02:00.036 --> 00:02:01.371
Let's rock!

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:02.038
M's...

00:02:02.038 --> 00:02:03.289
Music...

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:04.999
Start!

00:02:16.594 --> 00:02:21.725
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:02:21.725 --> 00:02:26.521
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:02:26.688 --> 00:02:31.484
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:36.072
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:02:36.072 --> 00:02:37.198
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:37.198 --> 00:02:41.035
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:02:41.035 --> 00:02:42.078
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:42.078 --> 00:02:45.832
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:46.916
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:51.004
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:55.633
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:02:55.633 --> 00:03:00.638
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:03:00.638 --> 00:03:05.310
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:10.482
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:03:10.482 --> 00:03:15.445
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:20.992
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:03:20.992 --> 00:03:28.541
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:03:29.918 --> 00:03:33.296
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:37.967
Hey, which club are you going to join?

00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:40.762
I was thinking about maybe joining the choir.

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:42.514
Then why not the school idol group?

00:03:42.514 --> 00:03:44.891
#3 - First Concert!
What!? No way, I could never!

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:46.434
Oh, ¢c'mon.

00:03:55.985 --> 00:03:58.029
I can tell you plan on sleeping in class again.

00:03:58.029 --> 00:04:00.448
Hey, isn't that them?

00:04:00.448 --> 00:04:00.990
Huh?

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:05.119
Are you the girls who formed
the school idol group?

00:04:05.119 --> 00:04:06.079
Oh, yes!

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:08.122
<i>Our group is called W's.</i>

00:04:08.122 --> 00:04:09.332
Muse?

00:04:09.332 --> 00:04:10.458
Oh, like hair mou—!

00:04:10.458 --> 00:04:10.959
No.

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:15.797
Oh, that's right. My little sister said she
heard about you on the Internet.

00:04:15.797 --> 00:04:16.881
Really?

00:04:16.881 --> 00:04:18.800
Your debut concert is tomorrow, right?

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.301
Yep, right after school.

00:04:20.301 --> 00:04:23.388
What's it going to be like?
Can you give us a preview?

00:04:23.388 --> 00:04:25.390
What? Right here?

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.517
C'mon, just a tiny taste!

00:04:32.981 --> 00:04:37.443
Very well! Swear to come see our concert,
and we'll show you a bit of our dance.

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:39.863
A special treat, from us to you!

00:04:39.863 --> 00:04:43.449
If you say you'll bring friends,
maybe we'll show you a little more...

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:44.367
Really?

00:04:44.367 --> 00:04:45.451
We'll go! We'll go!

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:46.870
Thanks so much!

00:04:47.203 --> 00:04:49.372
We'll show you a teeny bit of the beginning.

00:04:49.372 --> 00:04:51.374
Huh? Where's your third member?

00:04:51.374 --> 00:04:52.333
Huh?

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:55.211
Huh?

00:04:56.421 --> 00:04:58.006
There's no way.

00:04:58.006 --> 00:05:00.300
Huh? What's up with you?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.635
C'mon, you can do it, Umi-chan.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:03.428
I could...

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:09.309
We've practiced our singing and dancing
enough for me to feel confident, but...

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:12.729
When I think about doing such
things in front of others...

00:05:12.729 --> 00:05:14.022
You get all nervous?

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:18.192
Oh, yeah!

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:23.114
My mom said to pretend the audience is a
bunch of veggies when you get stage fright.

00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:24.949
Why vegetables?

00:05:25.491 --> 00:05:28.328
Here we go, everyone!

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:30.079
You want me to sing all by myself!?

00:05:30.079 --> 00:05:30.914
Wait, what?

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.666
This could be bad...

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:37.879
If Umi-chan's having a hard time,
we need to help her out somehow.

00:05:38.463 --> 00:05:41.424
L...I think I'll be fine as long
as we're not in front of a crowd!

00:05:41.758 --> 00:05:43.384
As long as we're not in front of a crowd...

00:05:47.555 --> 00:05:50.975
Instead of us thinking up ideas,
it'll be faster for you to just deal with it.

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.019
Let's go.

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:56.230
What?

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:58.107
Ta-da!

00:05:58.775 --> 00:06:00.985
Let's hand out fliers for our concert here.

00:06:00.985 --> 00:06:03.321
Th-There are so many people...

00:06:03.321 --> 00:06:06.115
Yeah, of course there are!
I chose this place on purpose.

00:06:06.115 --> 00:06:08.952
If we hand out fliers here, not only
can we promote our concert,

00:06:08.952 --> 00:06:12.372
but it'll get you used to
making a scene in public.

00:06:14.916 --> 00:06:16.250
They're all vegetables...

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.293
All vegetables...

00:06:17.293 --> 00:06:18.878
They're all vegetables...

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:26.719
Having trouble?

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:29.347
Nah, I'm doing just fine.

00:06:29.347 --> 00:06:31.849
But Umi-chan...

00:06:32.976 --> 00:06:35.687
Oh, it seems I procured a rare one.

00:06:35.687 --> 00:06:37.146
Umi-chan!

00:06:39.357 --> 00:06:41.067
You'll be okay here, right?

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:42.860
I should be, yes...

00:06:43.194 --> 00:06:44.988
Then let's get started.

00:06:44.988 --> 00:06:48.825
<i>Hey, W's is having their debut
concert soon, so please come see us!</i>

00:06:49.283 --> 00:06:50.284
Thanks bunches.

00:06:50.284 --> 00:06:52.036
Please come see our concert.

00:06:52.036 --> 00:06:53.246
U-Um...

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:56.457
Would you like one? Thank you very much!

00:06:56.457 --> 00:06:58.334
- Come see our concert!
- Please come see us.

00:06:58.334 --> 00:07:00.878
- The very first concert for y's!
- Don't want it.

00:07:01.587 --> 00:07:03.464
Oh, thank you.

00:07:04.007 --> 00:07:06.050
- Come see our concert!
- You gotta be more enthusiastic!

00:07:06.467 --> 00:07:11.597
Perhaps you're used to this from helping
around your family's store, but I'm not.

00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:14.058
- Kotori-chan's doing just fine, though.
- Thank you very much!

00:07:14.058 --> 00:07:15.935
It's the first concert for p's!

00:07:15.935 --> 00:07:17.311
Come on, keep up!

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:20.064
- No quitting till you hand them all out.
- Thank you very much!

00:07:20.064 --> 00:07:22.275
What? That's impossible!

00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:27.697
Hey Umi-chan, when I said I couldn't do five
laps on the stairs, what'd you say to me?

00:07:29.365 --> 00:07:31.409
Fine! I'll show you!

00:07:32.326 --> 00:07:33.661
Attend our concert!

00:07:34.203 --> 00:07:37.040
It's the first concert for p's!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.166
Um...

00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:41.044
Oh, I remember you from the other day.

00:07:41.044 --> 00:07:42.420
Yes, hello...

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:46.215
I'll...I'I go to your concert.

00:07:46.215 --> 00:07:47.216
Really?

00:07:47.216 --> 00:07:48.509
You'll come?

00:07:48.509 --> 00:07:51.179
In that case, instead of one or two,
please take my entire stack.

00:07:51.179 --> 00:07:52.346
Umi-chan.

00:07:52.346 --> 00:07:53.389
Fine, fine.

00:08:00.646 --> 00:08:03.941
Their movements seem different from ours.

00:08:04.609 --> 00:08:07.487
Like this? This? And this!

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:10.406
What happened?

00:08:10.406 --> 00:08:12.116
Our rank went up!

00:08:13.034 --> 00:08:16.454
The people who saw our
fliers must've voted for us!

00:08:16.454 --> 00:08:18.206
That's marvelous.

00:08:18.206 --> 00:08:19.957
Thanks for waiting.

00:08:19.957 --> 00:08:22.794
Hey, Kotori-chan. Look at this.

00:08:22.794 --> 00:08:24.170
That's amazing!

00:08:24.962 --> 00:08:26.964
Are those our outfits?

00:08:26.964 --> 00:08:30.843
Yep. I just picked them up from the store
where the finishing touches were put on.

00:08:31.385 --> 00:08:33.054
Crazy exciting!

00:08:33.763 --> 00:08:34.972
Ta-da!

00:08:36.933 --> 00:08:38.559
That's so cute!

00:08:39.268 --> 00:08:41.104
It looks like something
a real idol would wear!

00:08:41.104 --> 00:08:42.438
You think?

00:08:42.438 --> 00:08:44.857
Amazing! It's so amazing, Kotori-chan!

00:08:44.857 --> 00:08:47.318
I know it's not the real deal,

00:08:47.318 --> 00:08:50.113
but I tried my very best to make
it as high-quality as possible.

00:08:50.113 --> 00:08:51.531
It turned out great.

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:52.573
Kotori.

00:08:53.741 --> 00:08:55.368
Just how long is that skirt?

00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:56.744
Um...

00:08:56.744 --> 00:09:00.957
Do you understand? If the skirt fails to at
least reach my knees, I won't wear it!

00:09:00.957 --> 00:09:01.916
Understand!?

00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:03.084
O-Okay!

00:09:03.543 --> 00:09:08.047
I know I told you that I wouldn't wear it
if it doesn't at least reach my knees.

00:09:08.047 --> 00:09:11.092
But there's no way we can
do that. We're idols.

00:09:11.092 --> 00:09:15.263
No rule exists that states idols
must only wear tiny skirts!

00:09:15.263 --> 00:09:17.181
Maybe, but...

00:09:17.181 --> 00:09:20.059
It's a bit too late to change that now.

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:20.476
Right.

00:09:20.476 --> 00:09:22.687
This is so unfair!

00:09:22.687 --> 00:09:25.982
In that case, I will perform
in my school uniform!

00:09:25.982 --> 00:09:26.732
What?

00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:27.733
No way!

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:32.363
You've only yourselves to blame
for conspiring behind my back.

00:09:33.489 --> 00:09:37.118
But I want to succeed, no matter what.

00:09:38.369 --> 00:09:42.456
We wrote a song, memorized our
choreography, and got our outfits made...

00:09:42.456 --> 00:09:44.834
We've worked so hard all this time.

00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:50.131
I wanna be able to look back and be happy
that us three worked so hard together!

00:09:52.884 --> 00:09:57.388
I wannaaaaaaaaaaaa!

00:09:57.388 --> 00:09:59.348
What's gotten into you?

00:09:59.849 --> 00:10:02.810
I think I agree with her.

00:10:03.895 --> 00:10:07.565
I want the three of us to make
the concert a success, together.

00:10:08.191 --> 00:10:09.192
Kotori...

00:10:12.486 --> 00:10:15.406
Neither of you ever seem to play fair.

00:10:20.494 --> 00:10:21.662
Very well.

00:10:23.748 --> 00:10:24.874
Umi-chan...

00:10:26.667 --> 00:10:29.003
I love you!

00:10:31.047 --> 00:10:34.050
May our concert be a success.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:36.677
No, may our concert
be a mega success!

00:10:36.677 --> 00:10:38.387
I hope I won't be nervous.

00:10:38.387 --> 00:10:40.765
I hope everyone has fun.

00:10:40.765 --> 00:10:43.476
Please grant our wishes!

00:10:57.031 --> 00:10:58.199
Tomorrow...

00:10:58.908 --> 00:11:00.243
I'm looking forward to it.

00:11:04.038 --> 00:11:05.414
Love Live!

00:11:06.874 --> 00:11:09.835
This concludes the Welcome Party.

00:11:10.253 --> 00:11:13.172
Every club is currently accepting
prospective members,

00:11:13.547 --> 00:11:16.884
so please be sure to check out any
you have an interest in joining.

00:11:17.134 --> 00:11:18.844
Please take one!

00:11:19.303 --> 00:11:22.640
We'll be performing our first concert
right after this event, at 4:00 p.m.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.392
Please stop by!

00:11:24.392 --> 00:11:25.810
Thank you very much!

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:30.189
Please gather over here if you're
interested in joining the brass band.

00:11:31.232 --> 00:11:32.817
- Hey, which club do you wanna join?
- Please come to our concert.

00:11:32.817 --> 00:11:34.402
- What about Drama Club?
- We're having our first concert today.

00:11:34.402 --> 00:11:35.695
That sounds cool.

00:11:35.695 --> 00:11:37.655
I know, right? I'm pretty
confident in my acting skills.

00:11:37.655 --> 00:11:38.823
You are, huh?

00:11:38.823 --> 00:11:41.158
We can't afford to lose to the other clubs.

00:11:41.158 --> 00:11:41.826
Uh-huh.

00:11:41.826 --> 00:11:42.994
Thank you very much!

00:11:44.287 --> 00:11:46.497
It starts at 4:00 p.m.

00:11:46.497 --> 00:11:47.915
Please come see us!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:50.876
You're gonna help?

00:11:50.876 --> 00:11:53.129
Don't you want to rehearse?

00:11:53.129 --> 00:11:55.631
We don't want our school to close, either.

00:11:55.631 --> 00:11:59.552
That's why we want you to succeed, too.

00:11:59.552 --> 00:12:01.137
Thanks, you three...

00:12:01.137 --> 00:12:03.014
Ready? I'm turning the lights on.

00:12:03.014 --> 00:12:04.307
Okay!

00:12:04.807 --> 00:12:07.685
There's a concert starting in the auditorium!

00:12:07.685 --> 00:12:09.395
Looks good there!

00:12:09.395 --> 00:12:10.604
Okay!

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.359
This is so cute.

00:12:15.359 --> 00:12:16.777
How do I look? Good?

00:12:16.777 --> 00:12:19.196
Yes, you look very lovely.

00:12:19.196 --> 00:12:20.489
How's it fit, Umi-chan?

00:12:20.489 --> 00:12:21.324
Fine.

00:12:21.324 --> 00:12:25.077
We're the only three in here.
Hurry up and get changed.

00:12:25.077 --> 00:12:26.203
I kKnow...

00:12:27.997 --> 00:12:28.914
Oh?

00:12:37.298 --> 00:12:38.924
H-How do I look?

00:12:38.924 --> 00:12:40.384
Don't even start with me!

00:12:40.968 --> 00:12:42.928
Why're you being such a party pooper!?

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:44.972
Where'd all that confidence go?

00:12:44.972 --> 00:12:48.059
Um, well... The...

00:12:48.059 --> 00:12:48.559
"The"?

00:12:49.226 --> 00:12:51.896
Well, the mirror... When I saw myselfin it ...

00:12:51.896 --> 00:12:53.481
Take this!

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.233
No!

00:12:56.233 --> 00:12:59.362
What're you trying to hide?
You still have your skirt on.

00:12:59.362 --> 00:13:00.654
True, but still...

00:13:00.654 --> 00:13:02.573
Umi-chan, you look adorable.

00:13:04.116 --> 00:13:05.493
Come over here!

00:13:05.493 --> 00:13:07.953
I think it suits you better
than either of us, really.

00:13:07.953 --> 00:13:09.080
Wh-What?

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:13.459
See? It's less embarrassing if we all wear
them and stand side by side, right?

00:13:14.502 --> 00:13:17.213
Amazing. It truly does feel less embarrassing.

00:13:17.213 --> 00:13:20.007
Let's run through the routine one more time!

00:13:20.007 --> 00:13:20.966
Sounds good.

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:27.848
Actually...it's still embarrassing.

00:13:38.442 --> 00:13:40.986
Nice! I pranked you good!

00:13:40.986 --> 00:13:42.530
Please don't do that...

00:13:43.447 --> 00:13:46.075
Hey, let's check out Track Club together.

00:13:46.075 --> 00:13:47.868
What? Track Club!?

00:13:47.868 --> 00:13:49.703
But actually, I...

00:13:49.703 --> 00:13:53.082
Kayo-chin, you told me you wanted
to do something more athletic.

00:13:53.082 --> 00:13:53.416
What!?

00:13:53.791 --> 00:13:56.460
Let's do this!

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:58.129
Rin-chan!

00:13:58.921 --> 00:13:59.880
The First Concert For
p's! Come See Us! Really?

00:14:00.339 --> 00:14:01.757
You'll come?

00:14:02.967 --> 00:14:04.009
Someone...

00:14:04.009 --> 00:14:06.971
Someone rescue me!

00:14:10.975 --> 00:14:11.976
Worried about them?

00:14:12.351 --> 00:14:13.519
Nozomi.

00:14:13.978 --> 00:14:15.938
I'm thinking I'll hit the road.

00:14:20.401 --> 00:14:24.280
The first concert for our very own
school idol group, u's, is about to start.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:27.616
Please hurry and take your seats!

00:14:27.616 --> 00:14:28.993
It's finally time.

00:14:28.993 --> 00:14:29.952
Yeah.

00:14:29.952 --> 00:14:31.078
Yes.

00:14:34.331 --> 00:14:37.877
It'll be okay. We're right here with you.

00:14:37.877 --> 00:14:39.378
Honoka...

00:14:39.378 --> 00:14:43.090
What do you think we should
say at a time like this?

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:45.593
M's, fight on!

00:14:45.593 --> 00:14:47.803
Now we're an athletic club, are we?

00:14:47.803 --> 00:14:48.971
Oh, good point.

00:14:50.055 --> 00:14:53.809
Wait, how about we count up together!?

00:14:53.809 --> 00:14:54.977
That sounds neat.

00:14:54.977 --> 00:14:58.981
Okay, then I'll start us off! One!

00:14:58.981 --> 00:14:59.982
Two!

00:14:59.982 --> 00:15:00.941
Three!

00:15:10.993 --> 00:15:14.747
Let's make our first concert
as J's our greatest one!

00:15:14.747 --> 00:15:15.873
Yeah!

00:15:15.873 --> 00:15:17.291
Of course!

00:15:54.828 --> 00:15:55.913
I'm sorry.

00:15:57.957 --> 00:15:59.583
I did all I could, but...

00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:07.675
Honoka-chan...

00:16:08.175 --> 00:16:09.468
Honoka...

00:16:41.375 --> 00:16:42.876
Of course this happened.

00:16:42.876 --> 00:16:45.504
The world isn't that convenient.

00:17:04.315 --> 00:17:05.816
Hanayo-chan?

00:17:06.567 --> 00:17:09.069
Huh? Is the concert in here...?

00:17:09.612 --> 00:17:12.448
Huh? What?

00:17:13.741 --> 00:17:14.617
Let's start.

00:17:14.617 --> 00:17:15.492
What?

00:17:15.492 --> 00:17:17.494
We'll sing as loud as we can.

00:17:17.494 --> 00:17:18.621
Honoka...

00:17:18.621 --> 00:17:22.291
We worked so hard for this day, after all.

00:17:23.834 --> 00:17:24.835
We're gonna sing.

00:17:25.586 --> 00:17:26.962
Honoka-chan...

00:17:27.713 --> 00:17:29.006
Umi-chan!

00:17:29.006 --> 00:17:29.840
Right.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:45.272
I SAY...

00:17:45.272 --> 00:17:48.067
HEY! HEY! HEY, START DASH!

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:54.823
HEY! HEY! HEY, START DASH!

00:17:57.993 --> 00:18:01.205
Even baby birds swaddled in down

00:18:01.205 --> 00:18:03.832
will someday flap their wings
and take to the sky.

00:18:04.375 --> 00:18:09.630
They'll soar up high with wings
that grow big and strong.

00:18:10.673 --> 00:18:13.801
We won't ever think of giving up—

00:18:13.801 --> 00:18:16.553
Such a grand day will come for us.

00:18:17.179 --> 00:18:19.682
Surely you feel it as strong as us.

00:18:19.682 --> 00:18:23.060
The initial beat of our wings...

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.646
Change for tomorrow!

00:18:26.271 --> 00:18:29.233
Change for that higher hope!

00:18:29.233 --> 00:18:35.739
Let's try and change for the better,
bathed in a dazzling bright light!

00:18:35.739 --> 00:18:36.740
START!

00:18:37.616 --> 00:18:43.372
If you're imprisoned by a deep sadness,
crying will be the least of your worries.

00:18:43.831 --> 00:18:50.129
Allow your burning heart to blast
open a pathway to the future.

00:18:50.129 --> 00:18:56.301
If you're imprisoned by a deep sadness,
you will find no joy if you simply cry.

00:18:56.301 --> 00:18:59.596
Surely (We're sure)
all our dreams (all your dreams)

00:18:59.596 --> 00:19:03.267
Have the power (right this moment)
to bring about change!

00:19:03.267 --> 00:19:08.689
We believe in you—so let's START!

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:13.402
HEY! HEY! HEY, START DASH!

00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:19.658
HEY! HEY! HEY, START DASH!

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:23.829
It's like how you feel after a rainfall.

00:19:24.371 --> 00:19:27.541
You can feel your anticipation grow.

00:19:27.541 --> 00:19:30.252
And even if you stumble or fail...

00:19:30.252 --> 00:19:33.297
Treasure the memory!

00:19:33.297 --> 00:19:36.592
It helps tomorrow bloom.

00:19:36.842 --> 00:19:39.428
It helps make our hopes blossom.

00:19:39.595 --> 00:19:46.310
Let's hum the lively melody
that these feelings made bloom!

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.644
DASH!

00:19:47.644 --> 00:19:54.109
All you need is to accept our delight,
and then follow our lead and sing along.

00:19:54.109 --> 00:20:00.616
We can finally make our way
out of that emotional prison.

00:20:00.616 --> 00:20:03.410
All you need is to accept our delight.

00:20:03.786 --> 00:20:06.747
Follow our lead and you're sure to advance.

00:20:06.747 --> 00:20:09.833
It can feel (and it is)
so distant (as our dream),

00:20:09.833 --> 00:20:13.545
and maybe it's (merely)
a fragment, but we love it.

00:20:13.545 --> 00:20:19.051
That's why, to the future...we will DASH!

00:20:58.131 --> 00:20:59.258
The student council president...

00:21:00.843 --> 00:21:02.261
And what will you do now?

00:21:08.642 --> 00:21:10.018
We're gonna keep going.

00:21:10.018 --> 00:21:11.019
Honoka.

00:21:11.019 --> 00:21:15.858
I see no reason for you to
wish to continue, so why?

00:21:15.858 --> 00:21:16.984
Because I want to!

00:21:18.151 --> 00:21:22.614
I wanna sing and dance even more now.

00:21:22.614 --> 00:21:25.951
I'm sure Umi-chan and Kotori-chan
know where I'm coming from.

00:21:25.951 --> 00:21:27.286
I've never felt like this!

00:21:27.286 --> 00:21:29.913
I feel nothing but pride for
what we've accomplished!

00:21:31.039 --> 00:21:33.458
I want to believe in this feeling.

00:21:33.458 --> 00:21:36.420
It's possible no one will give us a chance.

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:39.298
Maybe we'll never get any support at all.

00:21:39.673 --> 00:21:44.928
But I still want to work hard and give
people what we're able to give them.

00:21:44.928 --> 00:21:48.348
I want to share my current feeling with them!

00:21:49.224 --> 00:21:50.225
Someday...

00:21:51.476 --> 00:21:56.481
I have every confidence that someday,
we'll fill this whole auditorium!

00:21:59.735 --> 00:22:02.112
A total defeat from the outset, huh?

00:22:14.917 --> 00:22:20.547
Sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:20.797 --> 00:22:26.094
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.386 --> 00:22:32.517
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.517 --> 00:22:39.441
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku Jjounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.441 --> 00:22:44.488
Mezasu no wa kireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim to
find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.405 --> 00:22:50.953
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:50.953 --> 00:22:56.208
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.417 --> 00:23:03.715
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.174 --> 00:23:09.388
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.388 --> 00:23:15.769
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.769 --> 00:23:21.650
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:27.072
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:39.209
Next time on Love Live!
"Maki Rin Pana"
